---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice | Bauhu" description="How Bauhu uses project enquiry information, contact details and uploaded site documents.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <section class="privacy-hero">
      <p class="kicker">Privacy Notice</p>
      <h1>How Bauhu uses enquiry information.</h1>
      <p>This notice explains how information submitted through the Bauhu website is used when you enquire about a residence, model home, development or remote-location project.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-content">
      <article>
        <h2>Information you may provide</h2>
        <p>When you start a project or submit an enquiry, Bauhu may collect your name, email address, phone number, preferred contact method, site location, project details, planning status, budget range, timing, notes and any supporting documents or images you choose to upload.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>How the information is used</h2>
        <p>The information is used to review the potential project, understand the site and project route, respond to your enquiry, assess feasibility, prepare for a follow-up conversation and manage the enquiry internally.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Uploaded documents</h2>
        <p>Uploaded files may include site plans, surveys, drawings, photographs, planning documents or other supporting material. These files are used only to understand and respond to the enquiry unless another use is agreed with you.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Who may see it</h2>
        <p>Project information may be reviewed by Bauhu team members and, where relevant, trusted professional advisers or delivery partners who need the information to help assess the project. Bauhu does not sell enquiry data.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>Bauhu keeps enquiry information for as long as reasonably needed to assess the project, respond to you, maintain project records and manage legitimate business requirements.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can ask Bauhu to correct, update or remove enquiry information where appropriate. You can also choose not to upload supporting documents and instead discuss them later.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or requests relating to information submitted through this website, contact Bauhu using the same email or contact channel used for your project enquiry.</p>
      </article>
      <p class="small-note">This notice is practical website guidance and should be reviewed by legal counsel before being treated as formal legal advice.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page{min-height:100vh;background:#ebe9e2;color:#17394c;padding-top:5.5rem}.privacy-hero{padding:5rem 5vw 4rem;background:#17394c;color:#f8f6f0}.kicker{margin:0 0 1rem;font:700 .68rem/1 Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8a96a}.privacy-hero h1{max-width:980px;margin:0;font:400 clamp(3.2rem,7vw,7rem)/.9 'Cormorant Garamond',serif;letter-spacing:-.055em}.privacy-hero p{max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem 0 0;font:300 1.1rem/1.7 Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(248,246,240,.72)}.privacy-content{display:grid;gap:1.2rem;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:4rem 5vw 5rem}.privacy-content article{padding:1.6rem;background:#f7f5ef;border:1px solid rgba(23,57,76,.14)}.privacy-content h2{margin:0 0 .8rem;font:400 2.1rem/1.05 'Cormorant Garamond',serif;letter-spacing:-.035em}.privacy-content p{margin:0;font:300 1rem/1.75 Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(23,57,76,.7)}.small-note{font:400 .78rem/1.6 Inter,sans-serif!important;color:rgba(23,57,76,.55)!important}
</style>
